<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Happy Birthday Maithili ❤️</title>

<style>
    * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
        font-family: "Poppins", Arial, sans-serif;
        background: radial-gradient(circle at top, #35105c, #12001f 65%, #050008);
        color: white;
        min-height: 100vh;
        overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    .page {
        min-height: 100vh;
        width: 100%;
        display: none;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 25px;
        text-align: center;
        animation: fadeIn 0.8s ease;
    }

    .page.active {
        display: flex;
    }

    .content {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 850px;
        padding: 35px 25px;
    }

    h1 {
        font-size: clamp(35px, 8vw, 70px);
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        color: #fff;
        text-shadow:
            0 0 10px #ff66c4,
            0 0 25px #ff1493,
            0 0 45px #ff1493;
    }

    h2 {
        font-size: clamp(28px, 6vw, 48px);
        margin-bottom: 25px;
        color: #ffd6f3;
        text-shadow: 0 0 15px #ff4db8;
    }

    p {
        font-size: 18px;
        line-height: 1.8;
        color: #f8eafa;
    }

    .intro {
        font-size: clamp(25px, 6vw, 45px);
        font-weight: bold;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .surprise {
        font-size: 18px;
        margin-bottom: 35px;
        color: #ffd5ef;
    }

    button {
        border: none;
        padding: 14px 30px;
        border-radius: 30px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff1493, #9b4dff);
        color: white;
        font-size: 17px;
        font-weight: bold;
        cursor: pointer;
        box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 20, 147, 0.6);
        transition: 0.3s;
        margin: 8px;
    }

    button:hover {
        transform: scale(1.08);
        box-shadow: 0 0 35px rgba(255, 20, 147, 0.9);
    }

    .note {
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
        border-radius: 25px;
        padding: 28px;
        backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(255, 0, 150, 0.15);
    }

    .special-box {
        text-align: left;
        margin-top: 20px;
    }

    .special-item {
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
        border-radius: 18px;
        padding: 18px;
        margin: 14px 0;
        border-left: 4px solid #ff4db8;
    }

    .special-item strong {
        color: #ff9ddd;
        font-size: 20px;
    }

    .special-item p {
        font-size: 16px;
        margin-top: 5px;
    }

    .experience-list {
        text-align: left;
        padding-left: 20px;
    }

    .experience-list li {
        margin: 18px 0;
        padding-left: 8px;
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.7;
        color: #f8eafa;
    }

    .magic {
        font-size: clamp(20px, 5vw, 32px);
        line-height: 1.8;
        font-weight: 500;
    }

    .glowing-name {
        color: #ff6bc8;
        animation: shine 1.5s infinite alternate;
    }

    .birthday-final {
        font-size: clamp(40px, 9vw, 75px);
    }

    .cake {
        font-size: 70px;
        animation: bounce 1.2s infinite;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .heart {
        position: fixed;
        bottom: -30px;
        font-size: 20px;
        animation: floatUp 6s linear infinite;
        pointer-events: none;
        opacity: 0.7;
    }

    .firework {
        position: fixed;
        font-size: 45px;
        pointer-events: none;
        animation: firework 1.5s ease-out forwards;
        z-index: 999;
    }

    .question {
        font-size: clamp(25px, 6vw, 45px);
        margin-bottom: 30px;
        font-weight: bold;
    }

    .answer {
        margin-top: 25px;
        font-size: 70px;
        animation: bounce 1s infinite;
    }

    .thanks {
        font-size: 25px;
        margin-top: 10px;
        color: #ffd1ef;
    }

    @keyframes fadeIn {
        from {
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(20px);
        }
        to {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateY(0);
        }
    }

    @keyframes shine {
        from {
            text-shadow: 0 0 5px #ff1493;
        }
        to {
            text-shadow:
                0 0 15px #ff1493,
                0 0 30px #ff69c4,
                0 0 50px #ff1493;
        }
    }

    @keyframes bounce {
        0%,100% {
            transform: translateY(0);
        }
        50% {
            transform: translateY(-12px);
        }
    }

    @keyframes floatUp {
        0% {
            transform: translateY(0) rotate(0deg);
            opacity: 0;
        }
        20% {
            opacity: 0.8;
        }
        100% {
            transform: translateY(-110vh) rotate(360deg);
            opacity: 0;
        }
    }

    @keyframes firework {
        0% {
            transform: scale(0);
            opacity: 1;
        }
        50% {
            transform: scale(2);
            opacity: 1;
        }
        100% {
            transform: scale(4);
            opacity: 0;
        }
    }

    @media(max-width:600px) {
        .content {
            padding: 25px 12px;
        }

        .note {
            padding: 20px;
        }

        p {
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        .experience-list {
            padding-left: 15px;
        }

        .experience-list li {
            font-size: 15px;
        }
    }
</style>
</head>

<body>

<!-- PAGE 1 -->
<section class="page active" id="page1">
    <div class="content">
        <div class="cake">🎂</div>

        <div class="intro">
            Hey My Birthday Girl ❤️
        </div>

        <div class="surprise">
            I have some surprise for you... 👀✨
        </div>

        <button onclick="nextPage()">
            Next 💌
        </button>
    </div>
</section>


<!-- PAGE 2 -->
<section class="page" id="page2">
    <div class="content">
        <h1>Happy Birthday Maithili 🎂❤️</h1>

        <div class="note">
            <p>
                Happy Birthday to the person who somehow became my best friend,
